sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Debug Outdoor Activity
  participant Trace as D06 trace recorder
  participant Raw as Raw recorder
  participant Writer as Bounded writer thread
  participant Native as Native GNSS
  UI->>UI: preview gate 및 explicit start
  UI->>Trace: start local binding / trace lease
  UI->>Raw: start async
  Raw->>Writer: private part open / header write flush
  Writer-->>Raw: opened token
  Raw->>Native: register measurements
  Native-->>Raw: registration success
  Raw-->>UI: start true and current identity
  UI->>UI: same readiness generation / step reset / ready
  Native-->>Raw: raw epoch
  Raw->>Writer: copied batch if current token and budget
  UI->>Trace: ready일 때만 위치·step·checkpoint
  UI->>UI: onPause 또는 stop / ready false·generation 증가
  UI->>Raw: stop
  Raw->>Writer: invalidate admission then drain
  Raw->>Native: unregister
  Writer->>Writer: footer·flush·close·성공 시 final name
  Writer-->>Raw: closed result
  Raw-->>UI: stop complete
  UI->>Trace: stop trace AFTER Raw close
  Trace-->>UI: completed 또는 pending finalization
  UI->>UI: 명시 SAF export 그리고 onResume 자동재시작 없음
